# EditorTest1's Generated.cs is checked in like BeefballKni's, for the same reason: its live-edit wiring
# (Game1.Generated.cs's GlueControlManager/GameConnectionManager construction) comes from
# MainCompilerPlugin.HandleGluxLoaded, which the headless test host can't run (it builds real WPF tabs and
# opens sockets on registration - see GoldProject.EmbedLiveEditCode). There is no in-test way to regenerate
# this file, so unlike every other gold project it is committed as produced by a real Glue session instead
# of regenerated by GoldProjectCompileTests. See LiveGameProcess.cs.
!/Samples/EditorTest1/**/*.Generated.Event.cs
!/Samples/EditorTest1/**/*.Generated.cs
